### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Menu inside a zone (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/menu?area=Bole&budget=25000
Accept: application/json

### Menu outside the zone (422 outside_delivery_zone)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/menu?area=Sululta
Accept: application/json

### Dishes: filtered, searched, sorted, paged (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes?area=Bole&fasting=1&q=doro&sort=-price&per_page=5&page=1
Accept: application/json

### One dish (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes/3
Accept: application/json

### Unknown dish (404 not_found)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes/9999
Accept: application/json

### Non-numeric id never matches the route (404 route_not_found)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes/abc
Accept: application/json

### Create a dish (201 + Location)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "name": "Kitfo", "restaurant_id": 3, "price": 38000, "is_fasting": false, "area": "Kazanchis" }

### Invalid dish (422 validation_failed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "name": "Kitfo", "price": -5, "area": "Sululta" }

### Change the price (200, cost_price ignored)
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "price": 19500, "cost_price": 100 }

### Delete (204, no body)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes/41
Accept: application/json

### Wrong verb on the collection (405)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/dishes
Accept: application/json

### Restaurants with dish counts (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/restaurants?sort=-name
Accept: application/json

### One restaurant by slug, with its dishes (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/restaurants/yod-abyssinia?include=dishes
Accept: application/json

### Unknown slug (404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/restaurants/no-such-place
Accept: application/json

### A restaurant's dishes, most expensive first (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/restaurants/yod-abyssinia/dishes?sort=-price
Accept: application/json

### Add a dish to a restaurant (201)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/restaurants/kategna/dishes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "name": "Misir Wat", "price": 16500, "is_fasting": true }

### Place an order (201 + Location)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "customer_name": "Almaz Bekele", "phone": "0911234567", "area": "Bole", "lines": [ { "dish_id": 3, "qty": 2 }, { "dish_id": 6, "qty": 1 } ] }

### Order outside the zone (422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "customer_name": "Dawit", "phone": "0911234567", "area": "Sululta", "lines": [ { "dish_id": 3, "qty": 1 } ] }

### Order history, cursor paged (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders?per_page=5
Accept: application/json

### Illegal transition (409)
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "status": "delivered" }

### Legal transition (200)
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "status": "preparing" }

### Cancel (200, then 409 if repeated)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/1/cancellation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "reason": "customer_unreachable" }

### Mark paid, safe to retry (200)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/2/payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "reference": "TB-100234" }
